Behavioural compatibility with Renovate (https://github.com/renovatebot/renovate)
is a goal of this project. Renovate is licensed under the GNU Affero General
Public License v3.0.

No source code, fixture table or other copyrightable expression from the
Renovate project has been copied into this repository. Where compatibility
required knowledge of Renovate's behaviour, that behaviour was observed by
executing a pinned Renovate container and recording its input/output pairs;
the implementation here was written from those recordings.

The preset library (config/preset/presets.json) is pinup's own, written for
the behaviour its configurations need under the names Renovate uses. Releases
up to 0.16.0 embedded a library generated from the preset definitions the
pinned container's resolver returned - obtained by execution, but identical
in content to Renovate's preset data, including its curated monorepo and
replacement lists. That library was replaced on 2026-09-14; see
config/preset/README.md and docs/tech-spec.md section 0.1.

This separation is what allows pinup to be permissively licensed while
reproducing the decisions of an AGPL-licensed program.
